# Openai Whisper

## Overview
This skill provides openai whisper functionality for CoreBlow agents.

## Usage
Add this skill to your agent configuration:
```yaml
skills:
  - openai-whisper
```

## Commands
- `/openai-whisper` — Main command
- `/openai-whisper help` — Show help
